" "value" "First, we need to convert $P$ to row echelon form:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P & =[\\begin{aligned}7 & 2 & 5 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 6\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & ↔{R}_{4} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}7 & 2 & 5 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLooking at the row echelon form, we see that $P$ has $3$ pivots. In particular, the pivot columns are the $1$st, $2$nd, and $4$th columns." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14040466/state.json" "file_sha256" "188a90c8d285115c8f9782c0822a031f73e5b982e9d16da506e3298b12c81776"} {"question" "q-131302" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14040466/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "2c680fda06fa2f83e46075e6ebe9b567cd34ab2f0257707276276bc6230ca565"} {"question" "q-131302" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14040466/state.json" "file_sha256" "188a90c8d285115c8f9782c0822a031f73e5b982e9d16da506e3298b12c81776"} {"question" "q-131302" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["text" "$1$st and $2$nd only"] ["text" "$1$st and $4$th only"] ["text" "$1$st, $2$nd, and $3$rd only"] ["text" "$1$st, $2$nd, and $4$th only"] ["text" "$1$st, $3$rd, and $4$th only"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14040466/state.json" "file_sha256" "188a90c8d285115c8f9782c0822a031f73e5b982e9d16da506e3298b12c81776"} {"question" "q-131302" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/text "